80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=20$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $80+20=100$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $80+20=100$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$100$","En":"$100$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$80+80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=80+20=100$","En":"$80+80\\times\\frac{25}{100}=80+20=100$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{100-80}{80}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{100-80}{80}\\times100=25$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 21، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 20.","En":"This price differs from the original by 21, but the required increase is 20."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 23، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 20.","En":"This price differs from the original by 23, but the required increase is 20."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 18، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 20.","En":"This price differs from the original by 18, but the required increase is 20."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. احسب الزيادة: $80\times\frac{25}{100}=20$.

2. أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $80+20=100$.

$80+80\times\frac{25}{100}=80+20=100$

$100$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{100-80}{80}\times100=25$

لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.$mw$,$mw$The new price equals the original price plus the increase.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. Calculate the increase: $80\times\frac{25}{100}=20$.

2. Add the increase to the original price: $80+20=100$.

$80+80\times\frac{25}{100}=80+20=100$

$100$ Currency units

$\frac{100-80}{80}\times100=25$

Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price.$mw$);
